<%- include("partials/header") %>

<section id="about">
    <div class="container col-xxl-8 px-4 py-5">
        <div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center g-5 py-5">
            <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-6"> 
                <img src="/images/megaphone.png" alt="a man holding a megaphone"
                    class="d-block mx-lg-auto img-fluid" width="700" loading="lazy"> 
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold text-body-emphasis lh-1 mb-3">No one hears you?</h2>
                <p>
                    Think no one hears you because you are the minority, having no money, no power, and low social status,
                    being unemployed, abandoned, being too old, or too young.  We are here to help.  SHOUT is a web site
                    giving the opportunity for everyone, who has the thought of being ignored in this cruel world, to have
                    their voice telling others what they are thinking.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Here, You can create a post and read others' posts.  You can also update and delete your previous posts
                    if you want.  If you need any help, you can always find help from the infomation on the
                    <a href="/contact">contact</a> page.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>